"hero": "\n<section class=\"page-hero\">\n<div class=\"shell\">\n{{ppp:breadcrumbs}}\n<span class=\"eyebrow\">Perth electrical</span>\n<h1>Electrician Perth — Electrical Repairs &amp; Installation</h1><aside class=\"intent-safety\" data-intent-safety><p><strong>Electrical danger comes before booking.</strong> For a shock or tingling tap, keep clear and call <a href=\"tel:131351\">Western Power 13 13 51</a>. For a life-threatening emergency or fire, call <a href=\"tel:000\">000</a>. <a href=\"https://www.westernpower.com.au/issues-enquiries/reporting-incidents-and-emergencies/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Official emergency guidance</a>. For loss of supply, check <a href=\"https://www.westernpower.com.au/issues-enquiries/reporting-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Western Power outage reporting</a> before assuming an internal circuit fault.</p></aside>\n<p>Book a Perth electrician for electrical fault finding, safety switches, lighting, power points and smoke alarm work. Our local licensed electrical trades assess the installation, explain the required repair or improvement and confirm the scope and price in a written quote.</p>\n<a class=\"button\" href=\"tel:0413477667\">Call 0413 477 667</a>\n</div>\n</section>" as TrustedHtml,
"sections": [
{
"id": "section-1",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section\">\n<div class=\"shell split\">\n<div>\n<h2>Electrical repairs and installations</h2>\n<h3 id=\"power\">Power faults and tripping circuits</h3>\n<p>Do not repeatedly reset a device that trips again. Note which areas lost power and what was in use at the time.</p>\n<h3>Switches and outlets</h3>\n<p>Report cracked, loose, discoloured, unusually warm or non-working accessories. Stop using anything that is damaged, sparking, buzzing or smells burnt.</p>\n<h3 id=\"lighting\">Lighting problems</h3>\n<p>Explain whether one light or several are affected and whether the issue changes when another device is used.</p>\n<h3>Electrical maintenance</h3>\n<p>Provide available history, including previous symptoms, recent water ingress or work elsewhere in the building.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<img class=\"photo\" src=\"electrical-repair.jpg\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"Electrical repair tools and wiring equipment\" srcset=\"electrical-repair-480.webp 480w, electrical-repair-800.webp 800w, electrical-repair-1200.webp 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1000px) 50vw, 380px\">\n<aside class=\"panel\">\n<h3>Immediate electrical safety</h3>\n<p>Do not touch exposed conductors, damaged switchboards, fallen powerlines or equipment in contact with water. If there is fire, smoke, active arcing or immediate danger, move away and call 000.</p>\n</aside>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"id": "section-2",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section\">\n<div class=\"shell split\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"eyebrow\">Managed properties</span>\n<h2>Electrical Maintenance for Perth Property Managers</h2>\n<p>Property managers can send a work order with the occupant’s description, affected area, access contact and approval pathway. Identify any strata-controlled areas where relevant.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<a class=\"button\" href=\"contact.html?service=electrical.html\">Send an electrical enquiry</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"id": "section-3",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"rich-band\">\n<div class=\"shell\">\n<span class=\"eyebrow\">Practical electrical information</span>\n<h2>Electrical Faults in Perth: Safety and What to Report</h2>\n<div class=\"split\">\n<div>\n<p>Electrical faults are best described by what is happening: a safety switch that will not stay on, lighting that has stopped working, an outlet that feels loose, or power loss in a particular area. Do not open switchboards, remove covers or test fixed wiring.</p>\n<p>For smoke, fire, active arcing, fallen lines or electrical equipment in contact with water, move clear and call 000. For a wider network outage or hazard, follow the advice of the relevant utility.</p>\n<h2>How electrical repair work is scoped</h2>\n<p>Our Perth electrical team starts with the affected area, the observable symptom, any safe warning signs and the property access details. We use that information to identify the repair scope. Fault location, access, equipment, materials and any additional work found during assessment are confirmed in a written quote before work proceeds.</p>\n<p>For homes, rentals, strata and commercial properties, do not attempt to diagnose from a switchboard or remove a fitting. Tell us what changed, what has been affected and whether there is a safe access contact. Our Perth team arranges a safe on-site assessment and confirms the electrical repair scope and quote.</p>\n<ul class=\"topic-links\">\n<li>\n<a href=\"safety-switch-tripping-perth.html\">Guide: a tripping safety switch</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"power-faults-perth.html\">Guide: power-fault symptoms</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"faq.html\">Read electrical FAQs</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<img srcset=\"electrical-switchboard-perth-480.webp 480w, electrical-switchboard-perth-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 540px) calc(100vw - 48px), 480px\" class=\"content-photo\" src=\"electrical-switchboard-perth.png\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"Electrician inspecting a residential switchboard\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"id": "section-4",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section\">\n<div class=\"shell\">\n<span class=\"eyebrow\">For homes and managed properties</span>\n<h2>Reporting Power Faults, Tripping Circuits and Lighting Problems</h2>\n<div class=\"rich-grid\">\n<article>\n<h3>Affected area</h3>\n<p>Note which rooms, lights, outlets or appliances are affected, without testing damaged equipment or dismantling anything.</p>\n</article>\n<article>\n<h3>What happened first</h3>\n<p>Record the time, what was in use, and whether rain, cleaning or water ingress preceded the change.</p>\n</article>\n<article>\n<h3>Visible warnings</h3>\n<p>Report heat, burning smell, cracking, buzzing, discolouration, smoke or water nearby from a safe distance.</p>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"id": "section-5",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section\">\n<div class=\"shell\">\n<span class=\"eyebrow\">Electrical services</span>\n<h2>Common electrical services we provide</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Electrical equipment should not be dismantled or tested by the occupant. Tell us what changed and whether there are visible warning signs.</p>\n<div class=\"price-guide\" aria-labelledby=\"ellis-price-guide\">\n<div class=\"shell\">\n<div class=\"price-guide__intro\">\n<p class=\"price-guide__kicker\">Ellis Price Guide</p>\n<h2 id=\"ellis-price-guide\">Electrical price overview</h2>\n<p>Ellis Price Guide ranges for common standard-hours, standard-scope electrical work.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"price-guide__grid\">\n<article class=\"price-guide__item\">\n<h3>Power-fault diagnosis / priority attendance</h3>\n<p class=\"price-guide__range\">AUD $220–$440</p>\n<p class=\"price-guide__unit\">per attendance · incl. GST</p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"price-guide__item\">\n<h3>Safety-switch diagnosis & testing</h3>\n<p class=\"price-guide__range\">AUD $220–$440</p>\n<p class=\"price-guide__unit\">per attendance · incl. GST</p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"price-guide__item\">\n<h3>RCD / RCBO replacement</h3>\n<p class=\"price-guide__range\">AUD $220–$330</p>\n<p class=\"price-guide__unit\">per device · incl. GST</p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"price-guide__item\">\n<h3>New power point</h3>\n<p class=\"price-guide__range\">AUD $165–$275</p>\n<p class=\"price-guide__unit\">per point · incl. GST</p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"price-guide__item\">\n<h3>LED downlight</h3>\n<p class=\"price-guide__range\">AUD $70–$160</p>\n<p class=\"price-guide__unit\">per light · incl. GST</p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"price-guide__item\">\n<h3>Standard hard-wired smoke alarm</h3>\n<p class=\"price-guide__range\">AUD $205–$275</p>\n<p class=\"price-guide__unit\">per alarm · incl. GST</p>\n</article>\n</div>\n<p class=\"price-guide__notice\">\n<strong>Guide conditions:</strong> These AUD ranges are for standard-hours, standard-scope work and are incl. GST. Access, materials, extra pipe, cable or circuit work, compliance work, emergency or after-hours work and unforeseen repairs are confirmed in a written quote before work proceeds.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"service-detail-grid\">\n<article class=\"service-detail\">\n<h3>Power faults</h3>\n<p>Loss of power in part of a property, recurring trips or an affected circuit. Note what was in use before the change.</p>\n<a href=\"power-faults-perth.html\">Discuss a power fault →</a>\n</article>\n<article class=\"service-detail\">\n<h3>Safety switches</h3>\n<p>A switch that will not remain on needs attention. Avoid repeatedly resetting it and record the affected areas.</p>\n<a href=\"safety-switch-tripping-perth.html\">Read the safety-switch guide →</a>\n</article>\n<article class=\"service-detail\">\n<h3>Lighting</h3>\n<p>One light or several lights not working, flickering or changing behaviour when another device is used.</p>\n<a href=\"lighting-power-points-perth.html\">Discuss lighting →</a>\n</article>\n<article class=\"service-detail\">\n<h3 id=\"outlets\">Switches &amp; outlets</h3>\n<p>Loose, cracked, discoloured, warm or non-working accessories should be reported without further use or investigation.</p>\n<a href=\"lighting-power-points-perth.html\">Discuss an outlet →</a>\n</article>\n<article class=\"service-detail\">\n<h3 id=\"smoke\">Smoke alarms</h3>\n<p>Repeated beeping, a fault indication or an alarm issue at a managed property can be described in the enquiry.</p>\n<a href=\"smoke-alarm-maintenance-perth.html\">Discuss a smoke alarm →</a>\n</article>\n<article class=\"service-detail\">\n<h3>Managed-property electrical work</h3>\n<p>Share access notes, tenant information, the work-order reference and any prior symptoms or water-ingress details.</p>\n<a href=\"property-management.html\">Property-management details →</a>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"id": "section-6",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section\" aria-label=\"Existing company electrical work photos\">\n<div class=\"shell\" data-electrical-work-gallery><div class=\"electrical-work-gallery\"><div class=\"electrical-work-gallery__heading\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Real work imagery</span><h2>Electrical work examples</h2><p>Electrical switchboard, lighting and power-point work.</p></div><div class=\"electrical-work-gallery__grid\"><figure class=\"electrical-work-gallery__card\"><img class=\"electrical-work-gallery__image\" src=\"/images/electrical-work/kitchen-lighting-in-progress-480.webp\" srcset=\"/images/electrical-work/kitchen-lighting-in-progress-480.webp 480w, /images/electrical-work/kitchen-lighting-in-progress-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) 50vw, (max-width:980px) 33vw, 25vw\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" alt=\"Kitchen ceiling with recessed lights being fitted\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><strong>Kitchen lighting work</strong><span>Lighting work in progress.</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"electrical-work-gallery__card\"><img class=\"electrical-work-gallery__image\" src=\"/images/electrical-work/kitchen-lighting-wide-480.webp\" srcset=\"/images/electrical-work/kitchen-lighting-wide-480.webp 480w, /images/electrical-work/kitchen-lighting-wide-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) 50vw, (max-width:980px) 33vw, 25vw\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" alt=\"Wide view of a kitchen with recessed lights\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><strong>Kitchen lighting work</strong><span>Kitchen lighting presentation.</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"electrical-work-gallery__card\"><img class=\"electrical-work-gallery__image\" src=\"/images/electrical-work/kitchen-lighting-finished-480.webp\" srcset=\"/images/electrical-work/kitchen-lighting-finished-480.webp 480w, /images/electrical-work/kitchen-lighting-finished-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) 50vw, (max-width:980px) 33vw, 25vw\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" alt=\"Kitchen with illuminated recessed ceiling lights\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><strong>Kitchen lighting work</strong><span>Completed lighting presentation.</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"electrical-work-gallery__card\"><img class=\"electrical-work-gallery__image\" src=\"/images/electrical-work/cabinet-cabling-480.webp\" srcset=\"/images/electrical-work/cabinet-cabling-480.webp 480w, /images/electrical-work/cabinet-cabling-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) 50vw, (max-width:980px) 33vw, 25vw\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" alt=\"Electrical cabinet with cabling and conduit\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><strong>Cabling work</strong><span>Cabling installation-stage work.</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"electrical-work-gallery__card\"><img class=\"electrical-work-gallery__image\" src=\"/images/electrical-work/underground-electrical-conduit-480.webp\" srcset=\"/images/electrical-work/underground-electrical-conduit-480.webp 480w, /images/electrical-work/underground-electrical-conduit-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) 50vw, (max-width:980px) 33vw, 25vw\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" alt=\"Underground trench with electrical conduit\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><strong>Conduit work</strong><span>Underground conduit installation-stage work.</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"electrical-work-gallery__card\"><img class=\"electrical-work-gallery__image\" src=\"/images/electrical-work/renovation-rewiring-480.webp\" srcset=\"/images/electrical-work/renovation-rewiring-480.webp 480w, /images/electrical-work/renovation-rewiring-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) 50vw, (max-width:980px) 33vw, 25vw\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" alt=\"Open renovation wall with electrical wiring\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><strong>Renovation wiring</strong><span>Electrical rough-in during renovation work.</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"electrical-work-gallery__card\"><img class=\"electrical-work-gallery__image\" src=\"/images/electrical-work/residential-switchboard-480.webp\" srcset=\"/images/electrical-work/residential-switchboard-480.webp 480w, /images/electrical-work/residential-switchboard-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) 50vw, (max-width:980px) 33vw, 25vw\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" alt=\"Residential electrical switchboard with its cover open\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><strong>Switchboard work</strong><span>Residential switchboard work example.</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"electrical-work-gallery__card\"><img class=\"electrical-work-gallery__image\" src=\"/images/electrical-work/safety-switch-closeup-480.webp\" srcset=\"/images/electrical-work/safety-switch-closeup-480.webp 480w, /images/electrical-work/safety-switch-closeup-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) 50vw, (max-width:980px) 33vw, 25vw\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" alt=\"Close-up of a safety switch and circuit breakers\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><strong>Safety-switch work</strong><span>Safety-switch work example.</span></figcaption></figure></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"shell text-column\"><p>These existing company work photos show installation stages and finished appearances. They are not documented Perth suburb case studies or evidence of a particular fault diagnosis, test result or compliance outcome. A photo of an installation stage does not confirm that the same scope is available for every property.</p><p>For the work you need now, read about <a href=\"lighting-installation-perth.html\">lighting installation and repairs</a>, <a href=\"switchboard-upgrades-perth.html\">switchboard repairs and upgrades</a> or <a href=\"rcd-testing-perth.html\">RCD testing</a>, then <a href=\"contact.html?service=electrical.html\">ask the Perth team to confirm the proposed scope</a>.</p></div>\n</section>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"id": "section-7",
"kind": "faq",
"container": "\n<section class=\"rich-band\">\n<div class=\"shell\">\n<span class=\"eyebrow\">A practical booking path</span>\n<h2>Booking an Electrician in Perth: Symptoms, Safety and Access</h2>\n<div class=\"service-process\">\n<article>\n<h3>Describe the symptom</h3>\n<p>Say what stopped working, where it is located and what changed first. Avoid diagnosing, opening covers or testing equipment.</p>\n</article>\n<article>\n<h3>Flag safety concerns</h3>\n<p>Report smoke, burning smell, heat, arcing, visible damage or water near electrical equipment from a safe position.</p>\n</article>\n<article>\n<h3>Share access details</h3>\n<p>For rental, strata and commercial properties, include the access contact and approval pathway with the request.</p>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- site-intent:start --><div class=\"intent-content shell text-column\" data-site-intent><h2>Electrical Fault Finding or Installation in Perth</h2><p>Fault finding establishes why existing equipment or a circuit is not working. Planned installation starts with the new fitting, its location and the existing supply. Record these as separate tasks if you need both. Vehicle electrics, refrigeration repairs and specialist energy systems are not automatically included in a household electrical enquiry. Discuss the equipment and proposed scope before purchasing a replacement or booking specialist work.</p><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"power-faults-perth.html\">Electrical fault finding</a></li><li><a href=\"safety-switch-tripping-perth.html\">RCD and safety-switch repairs</a></li><li><a href=\"lighting-power-points-perth.html\">Lighting and power-point work</a></li><li><a href=\"smoke-alarm-maintenance-perth.html\">Smoke-alarm maintenance and replacement</a></li><li><a href=\"fixtures-appliances-perth.html\">Appliance connections and related fixed electrical work</a></li><li><a href=\"faq.html\">Electrical booking and price questions</a></li><li><a href=\"lighting-installation-perth.html\">Lighting Installation &amp; Repairs Perth</a></li><li><a href=\"power-points-perth.html\">Power Point Installation &amp; Repairs Perth</a></li><li><a href=\"ceiling-fans-perth.html\">Ceiling Fan Installation &amp; Repairs Perth</a></li><li><a href=\"exhaust-fans-perth.html\">Bathroom Exhaust Fan Replacement Perth</a></li><li><a href=\"switchboard-upgrades-perth.html\">Switchboard Repairs &amp; Upgrades Perth</a></li><li><a href=\"rcd-testing-perth.html\">RCD Testing &amp; Safety Switch Checks Perth</a></li><li><a href=\"emergency-electrician-perth.html\">24-Hour Emergency Electrician Perth</a></li></ul><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:0:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:0:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:1:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:1:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:2:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:2:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:3:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:3:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:4:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:4:answer}}</details></div><!-- site-intent:end --></section>" as TrustedHtml,
"items": [
{
"question": "Is fault finding included in a repair price?",
"answer": "<p>Investigation and repair can be different stages. Ask what assessment is included, how an unresolved or intermittent fault would be handled, and which repair or replacement work needs separate approval. The written quote should make those boundaries clear.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Should I request a switchboard upgrade when power keeps tripping?",
"answer": "<p>A recurring trip does not establish that an upgrade is needed. Request an assessment of the affected installation first. Replacement or additional circuit work should follow the findings and an agreed scope, not the symptom alone.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Can I book an after-hours electrician online?",
"answer": "<p>Routine service hours: 09:00–21:00, seven days a week. 24-hour emergency repairs are available; call to confirm attendance arrangements and the quoted emergency work. No arrival time is guaranteed. Call 0413 477 667 for urgent work; an online form does not reserve an appointment. For shock or network danger, use the official safety route first.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "What are your routine hours and emergency arrangements?",
"answer": "<p>Routine service hours: 09:00–21:00, seven days a week. 24-hour emergency repairs are available; call to confirm attendance arrangements and the quoted emergency work. No arrival time is guaranteed. Emergency repair fees follow the quoted work plan. For urgent work, call rather than relying on an online enquiry.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "What household electrical work requires a licensed electrician in WA?",
"answer": "<p>Arrange fixed wiring and power-point work through appropriately licensed electrical professionals and verify the relevant current documentation. <a href=\"#learn-about-electrical\">Read the explanation.</a></p>" as TrustedHtml
}
]
},
{
"id": "section-8",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<!-- keyword-gap:start --><section class=\"section keyword-gap-content\" data-keyword-gap><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><div class=\"keyword-gap-part\" id=\"gap-electrical-prices\"><h2>Electrician costs in Perth: investigation or installation?</h2><p>An electrical fault-finding visit investigates a reported problem. A planned installation quote starts with the fitting or outlet you want and the work needed at that location. Keep both tasks visible if you need an existing fault assessed as well as new equipment installed.</p><p>For a useful price comparison, check attendance, investigation, parts, electrical work and any additional access separately. Ask what happens if a fault is intermittent or the initial visit identifies further work. The published guide is not a promise of unlimited investigation, a free call-out or a fixed hourly rate.</p><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"power-faults-perth.html\">Electrical fault finding and investigation costs</a></li><li><a href=\"lighting-power-points-perth.html#gap-power-point-installation\">Power-point installation requirements</a></li><li><a href=\"faq.html\">Electrical quote and booking questions</a></li><li><a href=\"fixtures-appliances-perth.html\">Fixed electrical work versus appliance connections</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"keyword-gap-part\" id=\"gap-electrical-regions\"><h2>Find the region for your electrical work</h2><p>Use the property location as well as the service when making the request. For a rental or strata building, add the access contact and the person who can approve the work. A suburb in the directory does not confirm an appointment or specialist service capability.</p><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"perth-cbd-inner-suburbs.html\">CBD and Inner Perth</a></li><li><a href=\"northern-suburbs.html\">Northern Suburbs, including Joondalup</a></li><li><a href=\"southern-suburbs.html\">Southern Suburbs, including Canning Vale</a></li><li><a href=\"eastern-suburbs.html\">Eastern Suburbs</a></li><li><a href=\"western-suburbs.html\">Western Suburbs</a></li><li><a href=\"perth-hills-swan-valley.html\">Perth Hills and Swan Valley</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"keyword-gap-part\" id=\"learn-about-electrical\"><h2>Electrician Perth: symptoms and service choices</h2><h3>Household work for licensed electrical professionals</h3><p>Fixed wiring, power points and fixed electrical installation work should be arranged through appropriately licensed electrical professionals, not an unlicensed general handyman. Ask for the current documentation relevant to the work; an ABN alone does not verify trade authorisation.</p><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"about.html\">Requesting the documentation relevant to the work</a></li></ul></div></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
},
